note the entry, last in the unit: w is lo, hi, pc, 0; o gets the text without a NUL;
note the result is the text length, plus KUNK when no row matched
fn sm121_dis w view ulong 4 o edit uchar ON to ulong
note omega-bridge bc11b30b takes only a literal new length: 1024 is PW, 122 is RW
pl = new ulong 1024 0
rl = new ulong 122 0
pinit pl
rinit rl
p = guard o get w 0
lob = and get w 0 not GUARD
hib = and get w 1 HIMASK
q = imad o p pl lob hib
if gt q p
ret q
end
i = mrow rl pl lob hib
if lt i NROWS
ret rend o p pl w i
end
ret unk o pl w
end

